<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>HES Systems Department</title>
  <style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap');

:root {
  --bg: #d39b53;
  --panel: #e0b455;
  --panel-2: #bb7c29;
  --border: #e65555;
  --text: #2bff0083;
  --muted: #ff0000;
  --accent: #d6ac37;
  --accent-2: #4da3ff;
  --warning: #ff0000;
  --good: #4ce28c;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 85% 10%, rgba(55,214,194,.09), transparent 28rem),
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 45%, rgba(77,163,255,.06), transparent 24rem),
    var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.topbar {
  min-height: 78px;
  padding: 14px 6vw;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 25px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: rgba(7,16,24,.88);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 10;
}

.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.brand-mark {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 44px; height: 44px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(55,214,194,.45);
  border-radius: 10px;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -1px;
  background: rgba(55,214,194,.08);
}
.brand h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; }
.brand span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }

nav { display: flex; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; }
nav a {
  color: var(--muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 8px 11px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  font-size: 13px;
}
nav a:hover { color: var(--text); background: var(--panel); }

main { width: min(1180px, 88vw); margin: auto; }

.hero {
  min-height: 370px;
  padding: 75px 0 45px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 40px;
}
.eyebrow {
  margin: 0 0 9px;
  color: var(--accent);
  font: 700 11px "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
  letter-spacing: 1.8px;
}
.hero h2, .section h2 {
  margin: 0;
  letter-spacing: -1.5px;
}
.hero h2 { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 55px); max-width: 680px; }
.hero-text { color: var(--muted); max-width: 650px; margin: 15px 0 25px; }

.primary-btn {
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #061310;
  padding: 12px 17px;
  font-weight: 800;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: transform .2s, opacity .2s;
}
.primary-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
.primary-btn.loading { opacity: .7; }

.refresh-text { margin-left: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }

.hero-card {
  width: 210px; height: 210px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(55,214,194,.10), transparent 65%), var(--panel);
  box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(55,214,194,.08);
}
.hero-card strong { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
.hero-card span { color: var(--good); font: 700 12px "JetBrains Mono", monospace; margin-top: 4px; }
.pulse {
  width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--good);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(76,226,140,.08), 0 0 22px var(--good);
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.stats-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 70px;
}
.stat-card, .panel, .status-list, .contact-panel {
  background: rgba(13,26,36,.82);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
}
.stat-card { padding: 20px; }
.stat-label { display: block; color: var(--muted); font: 600 10px "JetBrains Mono", monospace; }
.stat-card strong { display: block; margin: 8px 0 3px; font-size: 27px; }
.stat-card small { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }

.section { margin-bottom: 70px; }
.section-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.status-key { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }
.dot { display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--good); margin-right: 5px; }

.status-list { overflow: hidden; }
.system-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 42px 1.7fr 1fr auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.system-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.system-icon {
  display: grid; place-items: center;
  width: 40px; height: 40px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #162b39;
  color: var(--accent);
  font: 700 11px "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
}
.system-info strong { display: block; font-size: 13px; }
.system-info span { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 2px; }
.bar { height: 5px; background: #172733; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
.bar span { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--accent); border-radius: inherit; }
.badge { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px 8px; border-radius: 20px; }
.badge.good { color: var(--good); background: rgba(76,226,140,.08); }
.badge.warning { color: var(--warning); background: rgba(243,183,79,.08); }

.two-column { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
.panel { padding: 25px; }
.panel h2 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
.timeline > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50px 1fr; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.timeline span { color: var(--accent); font: 700 10px "JetBrains Mono", monospace; padding-top: 2px; }
.timeline p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
.timeline b { color: var(--text); }

.action-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
.action-grid button {
  min-height: 70px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #0b1720;
  color: var(--text);
  cursor: pointer;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 12px;
}
.action-grid button:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

.contact-panel {
  padding: 27px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 30px;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.contact-panel h2 { font-size: 22px; }
.contact-panel p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; max-width: 620px; }
.contact-info {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
  min-width: 210px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 12px;
}
.contact-info strong { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 5px; }

footer {
  width: min(1180px, 88vw);
  margin: auto;
  padding: 22px 0 35px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  color: #607784;
  font: 10px "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
}

@media (max-width: 800px) {
  .topbar { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
  nav { justify-content: flex-start; }
  .hero { padding-top: 45px; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  .hero-card { align-self: center; }
  .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .system-row { grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr auto; }
  .bar { display: none; }
  .two-column { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

@media (max-width: 500px) {
  main, footer { width: 92vw; }
  .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .system-row { gap: 10px; padding: 15px; }
  .system-info span { display: none; }
  .contact-panel { flex-direction: column; }
  .action-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .refresh-text { display: block; margin: 10px 0 0; }
}

  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-mark">HES</div>
      <div>
        <h1>Systems Department</h1>
        <span>Internal Operations Portal</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#dashboard">Dashboard</a>
      <a href="#systems">Systems</a>
      <a href="#operations">Operations</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="dashboard" class="hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Controll panel or smn.</p>
        <h2>SUP CODE GOONERS.</h2>
        <p class="hero-text">Dashbord time baby check the stuffz.</p>
        <button id="refreshBtn" class="primary-btn">↻ Refresh Status</button>
        <span id="refreshText" class="refresh-text">Last checked just now</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-card">
        <div class="pulse"></div>
        <strong>ALL SYSTEMS</strong>
        <span>NORMAL</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-label">ONLINE SYSTEMS</span>
        <strong>12 / 12</strong>
        <small>Is' all right mate</small>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-label">NETWORK LOAD</span>
        <strong>42%</strong>
        <small>Within normal range</small>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-label">OPEN INCIDENTS</span>
        <strong>02</strong>
        <small>Someone should really fix those (meh)</small>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-label">UPTIME</span>
        <strong>99.98%</strong>
        <small>Last 30 days</small>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="systems" class="section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">LIVE OVERVIEW</p>
          <h2>System Status</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="status-key"><i class="dot online"></i> Operational</span>
      </div>

      <div class="status-list">
        <div class="system-row">
          <div class="system-icon">NW</div>
          <div class="system-info"><strong>Roblox/web API</strong><span>*ugh* if AWS is down again-</span></div>
          <div class="bar"><span style="width:92%"></span></div>
          <span class="badge good">Operational</span>
        </div>
        <div class="system-row">
          <div class="system-icon">DB</div>
          <div class="system-info"><strong>Discord Bot_1</strong><span>AutoMod or smn.</span></div>
          <div class="bar"><span style="width:84%"></span></div>
          <span class="badge good">Operational</span>
        </div>
        <div class="system-row">
          <div class="system-icon">FS</div>
          <div class="system-info"><strong>File Services</strong><span>Department shared storage</span></div>
          <div class="bar"><span style="width:71%"></span></div>
          <span class="badge warning">"Ooow what does this do??? *Poke Boom*</span>
        </div>
        <div class="system-row">
          <div class="system-icon">AU</div>
          <div class="system-info"><strong>Authentication Service</strong><span>Internal account services</span></div>
          <div class="bar"><span style="width:96%"></span></div>
          <span class="badge good">Operational</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="operations" class="section two-column">
      <div class="panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">RECENT ACTIVITY</p>
        <h2>Operations Log</h2>
        <div class="timeline">
          <div><span>21:04</span><p><b>Network check completed</b><br>All core switches responding normally.</p></div>
          <div><span>20:37</span><p><b>Backup completed</b><br>Nightly operations backup verified.</p></div>
          <div><span>19:52</span><p><b>File service alert</b><br>Storage utilization crossed 70% "N-No. You do not need a 'Homework folder' with 3 PETABYTES? OF POR-".</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">QUICK ACTIONS</p>
        <h2>Department Tools</h2>
        <div class="action-grid">
          <button>System Diagnostics</button>
          <button>View Incidents</button>
          <button>Network Tools</button>
          <button>Maintenance Log</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="section contact-panel">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">NEED ASSISTANCE?</p>
        <h2>Systems Department</h2>
        <p>For internal system issues, maintenance requests, or access problems, do not contact the Systems Department. (Or at least not me)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-info">
        <strong>Systems Desk</strong>
        <span>Extension 4100</span>
        <span>idontgetpaidenough@ihatemylife.com</span>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <span>HES Systems Department • Internal Use Only</span>
    <span>v1.0.0.0.10/span>
  </footer>

  <script>
    const button = document.getElementById("refreshBtn");
    const text = document.getElementById("refreshText");

    button.addEventListener("click", () => {
      button.classList.add("loading");
      button.textContent = "↻ Checking...";
      setTimeout(() => {
        button.classList.remove("loading");
        button.textContent = "✓ Status Updated";
        text.textContent = "Last checked just now";
        setTimeout(() => button.textContent = "↻ Refresh Status", 1800);
      }, 900);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
